<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: 'row', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 360, height: 720, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '70px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 6, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 3, marginBottom: 26 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>四大配套{'\n'}模块</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 22, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>把"控制设备"包进完整的生活闭环：注册登录看天气，逛商城补耗材，环境异常有联动。</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 36, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>设计原则：一切校验与判定收敛在后端，前端只负责展示与体验。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 720, padding: '56px 40px 40px 36px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 12, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <FAIcon name='user' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 6 }}>账号与安全</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>密码 BCrypt 加盐哈希入库；邮箱验证码注册（QQ SMTP 发信，Redis 60 秒冷却 + 验证码一次性）；JWT 拦截器统一鉴权；广告启动页 15 秒可跳过。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 12, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <FAIcon name='chart-line' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 6 }}>环境监测与场景联动</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>房间级温度 / 湿度 / AQI / CO₂ / 烟雾（厨房加燃气），后端 30 秒模拟漂移；阈值判定只在后端（烟雾 50 / 燃气 200 / CO₂ 1500 / AQI 150）；支持场景执行与 23:00 晚安定时场景。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 12, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <FAIcon name='cloud' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 6 }}>真实三方：和风天气</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>后端代理转发 + 10 分钟内存缓存，API KEY 永不进入 App；33 城清单，首页天气卡 60 分钟自动刷新。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 12, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <FAIcon name='shopping-cart' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 6 }}>商城与订单</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>商品 / 购物车 / 订单三件套；下单是数据库事务（扣库存 + 明细快照 + 清购物车）；金额字段一律 BigDecimal，杜绝浮点误差。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 40, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智慧家居 App（仿米家）· 课程结项答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>09 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
